<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S7.SS4" title="In 7 Pilot Results ‣ Extending MONA in Camera Dropbox: Reproduction, Learned Approval, and Design Implications for Reward-Hacking Mitigation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7.4 </span>Seed Variability and Execution Provenance</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S8" title="In Extending MONA in Camera Dropbox: Reproduction, Learned Approval, and Design Implications for Reward-Hacking Mitigation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">8 </span>Discussion</span></a>
