<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S8.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In 8 Discussion ‣ Extending MONA in Camera Dropbox: Reproduction, Learned Approval, and Design Implications for Reward-Hacking Mitigation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">The public MONA result remains robustly motivating.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S8.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In 8 Discussion ‣ Extending MONA in Camera Dropbox: Reproduction, Learned Approval, and Design Implications for Reward-Hacking Mitigation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Learned approval does not solve oversight.</span></a></li>
