</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FCF5F7;" fill="#FCF5F7" stroke-width="0.45pt"><path d="M 451.25 -259.84 L 328.28 -259.84 C 325.99 -259.84 324.13 -261.7 324.13 -263.99 L 324.13 -287.19 C 324.13 -289.48 325.99 -291.34 328.28 -291.34 L 451.25 -291.34 C 453.54 -291.34 455.4 -289.48 455.4 -287.19 L 455.4 -263.99 C 455.4 -261.7 453.54 -259.84 451.25 -259.84 Z M 324.13 -291.34"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.45pt" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 328.74 -279.43)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:9em;--ltx-fo-height:0.56em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="7.69" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 7.69)" width="124.53"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="S3.F1.pic1.5" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_top" style="width:9em;">
<span id="S3.F1.pic1.5.1" class="ltx_p"></span>
