</figure>
<div id="S6.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S6.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">This design moves from exact, trusted value functions toward learned approximations closer to the sort of imperfect overseers a practical system must rely on.
It is directly motivated by the original paper’s warning that approval quality and outcome dependence are not secondary implementation details but central to whether MONA preserves its safety benefits <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib6" title="" class="ltx_ref">6</a>]</cite>.</p>
</div>
