</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S9.T3.5.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S9.T3.5.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">
<span id="S9.T3.5.6.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S9.T3.5.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="S9.T3.5.6.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Scientific automation</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S9.T3.5.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">
<span id="S9.T3.5.6.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S9.T3.5.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="S9.T3.5.6.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Statistical significance</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S9.T3.5.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">
<span id="S9.T3.5.6.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S9.T3.5.6.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="S9.T3.5.6.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Peer review, replication checks</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S9.T3.5.6.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">
<span id="S9.T3.5.6.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S9.T3.5.6.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="S9.T3.5.6.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Process-based approval (pre-registration) vs. outcome-based (significance)</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S9.T3.5.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S9.T3.5.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">
<span id="S9.T3.5.7.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S9.T3.5.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="S9.T3.5.7.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Cybersecurity</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S9.T3.5.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">
<span id="S9.T3.5.7.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S9.T3.5.7.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="S9.T3.5.7.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Detection/prevention rate</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S9.T3.5.7.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">
<span id="S9.T3.5.7.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S9.T3.5.7.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="S9.T3.5.7.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Intrusion detection system</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S9.T3.5.7.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">
